<title>UK: L-Bank sets 3.0 bln Ffr bond due 2009.</title>
<headline>L-Bank sets 3.0 bln Ffr bond due 2009.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers BNP and CNCA.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BADEN-WURTTEMBERG L-FINANCE NV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  L-BANK - LANDESKREDITBANK BADEN-WUERTTEMBERG</p>
<p> AMT    3.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    06.FEB.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.168   PAY DATE    06.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.518    SPREAD	+13 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX/PAR   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M</p>
<p>SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR/GE/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GER	 TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.35	SELL CONC  1.65	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
